msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:66
#: 5e134719675b4492ae2f169fc1d9601f
msgid "If the ESCs are already connected to the autopilot (via DroneCAN), they can be configured using Mission Planner's DroneCAN/UAVCAN page or the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI Tool <common-uavcan-gui>`.  Alternatively, the `AM32 configurator <https://am32.ca/configurator>`__ can be used by directly connecting to the ESC's PWM connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:68
#: 51525b4c24184acba87a16af4790b660
msgid "In most cases at least some of the following parameters will need to be changed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:70
#: 9f439f0f1a094e759efb4eca88cc8428
msgid "ESC_INDEX: The motor number - 1.  For multicopters the motor number and position are shown on the :ref:`ESCs and Motors wiki page <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:71
#: 9f27a05281a447cf81849d9de0b69527
msgid "DIR_REVERSED: the motor direction.  Use Mission Planner's motor test page to check the direction and change this parameter if necessary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:72
#: 878c43aa883a450686422280447ff817
msgid "MOTOR_POLES: the number of poles in the motor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:73
#: 1010b71bdabb4637bad5a50e4fc4c111
msgid "MOTOR_KV: the motor's KV rating"
msgstr ""

